Z||000011||spike||05-25-99||07:03 AM||||I HAVE SEEN IT FOR MY OWN EYES. NOT THIS CAR BUT A 84 SE WITH A SMALL BLOCK MOUNTED FROM FRONT TO BACK. HE RAN A 12.64 @ 111MPH 1/4 MILE. HE DID NOT HEAT HIS TIRES AT ALL. WHEN HE WAS AT THE LIGHTS HE WAS ADVANCING FORWARD IN BURST AND AT EACH HIT OF THE THROTLE HIS FRONT END LIFTED OFF THE GROUND. IT WAS NOT QUITE AS HIGH AS THIS BUT CLOSE. HE DID NOT SPIN HIS TIRES ONE BIT AT TAKE-OFF. HE JUST WENT LIKE A BAT OUT OF HELL. I TRIED TO SPEAK TO HIM BUT WAS NOT ABLE. I WENT BACK TO NAPIERVILLE THIS PAST WEEK-END BUT HE WASN'T THERE. I WILL BE GOING BACK AGIN THIS WEEK-END, MAYBE I WILL GET LUCKY AND SEE IT AGAIN. I WOULD REALLY LIKE TO KNOW HOW HE HAS THE ENGINE AND TRANNY SET UP TO BE MOUNTED THIS WAY. <br>
